Description: desktop application for creating diagrams
 draw.io Desktop is an offline diagram editor for flowcharts, process diagrams,
 UML, ER diagrams, network diagrams and many other visual models.
 .
 This unofficial package uses Foundry's shared, versioned Electron 42 runtime.
